# Master SEO & Search Strategy Guide

The modern search ecosystem requires a dual-pronged strategy: dominating traditional organic search results (Google, Bing) while actively securing citations and recommendations in generative AI engines (Google AI Overviews, Perplexity, ChatGPT Search, Gemini, Claude).

Use this skill as your command center for diagnosing, prioritizing, and executing comprehensive SEO campaigns.

